  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25145700",
      "title": "Fallback Pages & \"Not Found\" Pages",
      "lectureOrder": 280,
      "videoOrder": 261,
      "sourceHash": "65a807edc4117ae7dbc6c186b7c66e8388b76a1ca7d65d61b96aa4e105a7d790",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.15,
          "end": 3.091,
          "en": "So now that we understand",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.091,
          "end": 5.69,
          "en": "this concept of having a fallback",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.69,
          "end": 10.61,
          "en": "and of generating certain pages for certain IDs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.61,
          "end": 13.85,
          "en": "let's take another look at the not found case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.85,
          "end": 18.03,
          "en": "that we're trying to request a page which doesn't exist.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.03,
          "end": 21.85,
          "en": "And let's start by simply visiting a page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.85,
          "end": 23.753,
          "en": "with a product ID of P4.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.91,
          "end": 28.34,
          "en": "Now we get a 404 error page here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.34,
          "end": 32.33,
          "en": "So a not found page because in our data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 32.33,
          "end": 36.13,
          "en": "we only have the IDs P1, P2 and P3.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 36.13,
          "end": 39.69,
          "en": "There is no product with an ID of P4.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 39.69,
          "end": 42.31,
          "en": "Now we get this not found error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 42.31,
          "end": 44.89,
          "en": "because in getStaticPaths,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.89,
          "end": 49.16,
          "en": "we load and build our array of IDs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 49.16,
          "end": 52.64,
          "en": "our array of routes or of parameters",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 52.64,
          "end": 55.15,
          "en": "for which pages should be generated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 55.15,
          "end": 59.04,
          "en": "from that dummy-backend.json file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 59.04,
          "end": 63.15,
          "en": "So paths with params here in the end is an array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 63.15,
          "end": 65.82,
          "en": "where we only configure param pairs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 67.437,
          "end": 72.437,
          "en": "So pid value pairs for the values P1, P2, P3",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 73.61,
          "end": 76.43,
          "en": "since these are the only IDs that exist",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 76.43,
          "end": 79.89,
          "en": "in that dummy-backend.json file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 79.89,
          "end": 84.28999999999999,
          "en": "And automatically if we then try to load this page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 84.28999999999999,
          "end": 87.541,
          "en": "for an ID which was not pre-generated,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 87.541,
          "end": 91.46000000000001,
          "en": "we do get this 404 error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 91.46000000000001,
          "end": 93.41,
          "en": "Now that makes sense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 93.41,
          "end": 96.91,
          "en": "What if we use fallback true though?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 96.91,
          "end": 101.05,
          "en": "What if we for example assume that the products",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 101.05,
          "end": 105.89,
          "en": "stored in dummy-backend.json might not be all the products",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 105.89,
          "end": 109.00999999999999,
          "en": "for which we are able to fetch data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 109.00999999999999,
          "end": 113.67,
          "en": "So we only generate pages for the three product IDs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 113.67,
          "end": 117.49000000000001,
          "en": "we find in that file, because we go through that file here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 117.49000000000001,
          "end": 119.58,
          "en": "in getStaticPaths",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 119.58,
          "end": 122.45,
          "en": "but by setting fallback to true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 122.45,
          "end": 125.8,
          "en": "we then also tell Next.js",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 125.8,
          "end": 130.8,
          "en": "that even if an ID value is not found here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 131.14,
          "end": 134.7,
          "en": "we still might be able to render a page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 134.7,
          "end": 136.95,
          "en": "That's what the idea behind fallback is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 136.95,
          "end": 140.72,
          "en": "that we don't have to predefine all possible pages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 140.72,
          "end": 144.203,
          "en": "all possible values for the dynamic segment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 145.18,
          "end": 149.28,
          "en": "So therefore, now if I set fallback to true here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 149.28,
          "end": 153.59,
          "en": "we will see that if I visit p4",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 153.59,
          "end": 156.14,
          "en": "I get this error that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 156.14,
          "end": 159.5,
          "en": "we cannot read the property title of undefined.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 159.5,
          "end": 162.32,
          "en": "Now we saw that before in the course already",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 162.32,
          "end": 164.22,
          "en": "we get this because we need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 164.22,
          "end": 167.44,
          "en": "to have this fallback scenario here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 167.44,
          "end": 170.57,
          "en": "that we're still waiting for a product",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 170.57,
          "end": 174.41,
          "en": "because when we set fallback to true and not to blocking",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 174.41,
          "end": 178.06,
          "en": "then Next.js will instantly return a page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 178.06,
          "end": 180.31,
          "en": "which does not yet have the data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 180.31,
          "end": 183.12,
          "en": "And it will load the data in the background",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 183.12,
          "end": 186.88,
          "en": "and give it to us on the page and re render the page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 186.88,
          "end": 188.95,
          "en": "once the data is there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 188.95,
          "end": 192.46,
          "en": "So we need to render this fallback for the time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 192.46,
          "end": 195.273,
          "en": "we're waiting for the product to load.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 196.53,
          "end": 201.26,
          "en": "But if I now do that and I reload, you see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 201.26,
          "end": 203.2,
          "en": "we see loading here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 203.2,
          "end": 206.01,
          "en": "but then after a while we get another error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 206.01,
          "end": 208.85,
          "en": "failed to load static props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 208.85,
          "end": 212.05,
          "en": "And this hopefully also makes sense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 212.05,
          "end": 216.53,
          "en": "I'm trying to load this product page for an ID of P4",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 217.44,
          "end": 220.7,
          "en": "for which we just don't have any data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 220.7,
          "end": 223.16,
          "en": "because in getStaticProps",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 223.16,
          "end": 226.85,
          "en": "we are also reaching out to dummy-backend.json",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 226.85,
          "end": 231.22,
          "en": "and we're trying to find our product by ID in that file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 231.22,
          "end": 236.22,
          "en": "And we won't find a product with ID P4 in that file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 236.22,
          "end": 240.24,
          "en": "So we see loading initially as a fallback,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 240.24,
          "end": 243.41,
          "en": "but then Next.js tries to load the actual data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 243.41,
          "end": 246.38,
          "en": "for this page and it just fails there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 246.38,
          "end": 249.04,
          "en": "because we don't have such a product.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 249.04,
          "end": 252.06,
          "en": "So that's why we get this error eventually here then",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 252.06,
          "end": 255.54,
          "en": "because it failed to load the actual data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 255.54,
          "end": 257.9,
          "en": "Now that is a perfect example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 257.9,
          "end": 261.59,
          "en": "for setting the not found property on the object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 261.59,
          "end": 264.36,
          "en": "we return in getStaticProps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 264.36,
          "end": 267.29,
          "en": "Here when we try to get our product,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 267.29,
          "end": 271.28,
          "en": "we also wanna check if we don't have a product",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 271.28,
          "end": 273.15,
          "en": "and if we don't have a product.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 273.15,
          "end": 277.61,
          "en": "So if we failed to find a product for the given ID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 277.61,
          "end": 280.12,
          "en": "then we want to return an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 280.12,
          "end": 282.95,
          "en": "where not found is set to true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 282.95,
          "end": 286.93,
          "en": "By setting this, we are able to use fallback true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 286.93,
          "end": 290.36,
          "en": "and try to find a product for a parameter value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 290.36,
          "end": 292.179,
          "en": "which was not predefined here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 292.179,
          "end": 296.23,
          "en": "because maybe we do have that maybe dummy-backend.json",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 296.23,
          "end": 298.42,
          "en": "is a more dynamic data source",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 298.42,
          "end": 301.37,
          "en": "which could yield that product.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 301.37,
          "end": 303.93,
          "en": "But if we then still fail to fetch it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 303.93,
          "end": 306.47,
          "en": "we don't want to return to regular page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 306.47,
          "end": 309.6,
          "en": "with the missing data, which causes an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 309.6,
          "end": 312.33,
          "en": "But we then wanna show the not found",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 312.33,
          "end": 315.69,
          "en": "the 404 error page instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 315.69,
          "end": 318.04,
          "en": "So with that if we save this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 318.04,
          "end": 323.04,
          "en": "now you see for P4 I get loading and then the 404 page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 323.87,
          "end": 328.84,
          "en": "And for P3 on the other hand it still works as before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 328.84,
          "end": 330.92,
          "en": "So that's how we can then utilize",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 330.92,
          "end": 332.75,
          "en": "the not found property here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 332.75,
          "end": 337.15,
          "en": "in getStaticProps together with fallback true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 337.15,
          "end": 338.18,
          "en": "And of course, it's up to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 338.18,
          "end": 340.37,
          "en": "which combination makes the most sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 340.37,
          "end": 343.89,
          "en": "for your exact scenario and use case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 343.89,
          "end": 346.09000000000003,
          "en": "This is just one example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 346.09000000000003,
          "end": 351.09000000000003,
          "en": "and one other idea of using Next.js and its features.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
